		"en": [
			"The Federal Army's combat mass-produced mobile suit that appeared in the movie \"Mobile Suit Gundam F91\" has been made into a kit. The camera guard is made of clear parts. The rear armor rack opens and closes, allowing you to mount a beam rifle and comes with a beam rifle and a seal. The fingers are movable."
